          Key requirements
        </h2>

      <div class="l-media__body ">
        <h3>So how can reviewing work activities support effective teamwork?</h3>
<p>Working as part of a team whatever the industry can be both rewarding and challenging as every team member needs to feel valued and part of the group. So how can reviewing work activities support effective teamwork especially in a cyber security setting?</p>
<p>Reviewing should be a valued and memorable experience. It should involve finding a way of learning from the experience and using those findings to become more dynamic and productive. Whatever an individual’s role is within the team, reviewing work activities should be able to support effective teamwork by helping others to learn from the experience.</p>

      </div>
